# H-F14 A/B for D-FREED-INODE-HOME-NEVER-PUBLISHED-LIVE-CORE-AFTER-CLEAN-UNMOUNT,
# fix laps on 2/net/mesh/direct g2c (test29 test30): the campaign of
# tests/queues/recycle_sideread_ab_direct.queue and its continuation
# recycle_sideread_ab_direct_laps7to16.queue, on the same build (~/src/mxfs-e
# srcversion D91D7504990C6BD4175874E), the same settings and that queue's
# READING RULES unchanged, graded with the earlier laps as one campaign.  Run
# from ~/src/mxfs-e.
#
# WHY ONLY FIX LAPS (written before the first of these laps).  The rules' control
# condition is met: rsd8 (control) SCONTROL-SHOWS-CAUSE, its audit's only error
# AG 4 inobt-FREE agino 132 (ino 8388740) LIVE core gen 3489806086, and the
# lap's one P-RECYCLE-SIDEREAD line names that inode verdict=kept with the
# platter holding gen 3489806086 (test29/test30 _rsr.txt).  What the rules
# still need is a third fix lap with reach (rsd2 and rsd4 are the two, both
# SPASS; rsd9 had none).  The continuation was stopped after rsd11; its
# remaining laps were four control laps and one fix lap.  About four laps in
# ten reach on this configuration, so six fix laps.
#
# Bound: the freed_nodelay laps' 1680 s per lap (they ran 492-536 s).
